#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/rgbsplit0r.rst:10
msgid "Rgbsplit0r"
msgstr "Rgbsplit0r"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/rgbsplit0r.rst:14
msgid "This is the `Frei0r rgbsplit0r <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/FilterFrei0r-rgbsplit0r/>`_ MLT filter."
msgstr ""
"Este é o filtro `rgbsplit0r de Frei0r <https://www.mltframework.org/plugins/"
"FilterFrei0r-rgbsplit0r/>`_ de MLT."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/stylize/rgbsplit0r.rst:16
msgid "This video effect is found in the Misc section of effects. The effect takes the red, green and blue channels in the video and separates them by a given x and y amount to produce a rainbowish effect."
msgstr ""
"Este efecto de vídeo atópase na sección «Varios». Colle as canles vermella, "
"verde e azul do vídeo e sepáraas cos valores indicados de X e Y para "
"producir un efecto algo similar ao arco da vella."
